<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We must fight to maintain,</l><l>And enjoy this life everyday,</l><l>Read the word, call His name,</l><l>Praise and sing with Him throughout all the day.</l><l>There’s no need to wait to grow in life!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As we grow in this life,</l><l>God and man are mingled as one.</l><l>Life will build up the church,</l><l>And produce the New Jerusalem.</l><l>Then in us, God’s purpose is fulfilled!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
